✨ Partouche puts art at the heart of the player experience!

To celebrate the opening of its brand-new 5,000 m² gaming club in the heart of Paris, Partouche has transformed its spectacular atrium into an immersive digital art destination. Displayed across monumental screens, a curated selection of artworks creates a unique atmosphere where entertainment meets wonder.

Artpoint is proud to have curated six artworks from its catalogue, bringing together distinct visual universes designed to complement the venue’s architecture and elevate the visitor experience.

For the opening, works by Kaoru Tanaka, Neosutras, Matthew Keff, Hanne Lize and David Ariew are lighting up the space. ❤️

